WEBVTT

1
00:00:39.928 --> 00:00:43.356
I bring blue flowers through the shade.

2
00:00:43.989 --> 00:00:47.395
You lead me where the trees have made

3
00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.437
A little clearing, out of sight.

4
00:00:52.159 --> 00:00:55.580
I cannot meet your eyes quite right.

5
00:00:55.813 --> 00:01:01.872
I'm thirty-nine; I tell you so.

6
00:01:04.372 --> 00:01:09.603
You take my hand and will not go.

7
00:01:30.705 --> 00:01:34.292
I've walked this field inside my head.

8
00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:42.443
Now grass is living where I tread.

9
00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.491
The stream lies hidden past the trees.

10
00:01:51.126 --> 00:01:55.200
Your shoulder moves beneath the breeze.

11
00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:59.240
For once the world is here with me.

12
00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:04.480
For once I feel where I can be.

13
00:02:26.502 --> 00:02:32.223
A thrush sings out. Its notes take flight.

14
00:02:34.032 --> 00:02:38.974
For whom? There's no one else in sight.

15
00:02:41.576 --> 00:02:44.993
No mate appears, no rival calls;

16
00:02:45.617 --> 00:02:48.861
The fear I brought begins to fall.

17
00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:52.894
You turn towards me in the sun.

18
00:02:53.631 --> 00:02:59.963
My thoughts stop counting, one by one.

19
00:03:55.827 --> 00:03:59.328
I've walked this field inside my head.

20
00:03:59.802 --> 00:04:03.404
Now grass is living where I tread.

21
00:04:03.839 --> 00:04:07.418
The stream lies hidden past the trees.

22
00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:11.521
Your shoulder moves beneath the breeze.

23
00:04:11.829 --> 00:04:15.492
You lead me back across the land.

24
00:04:16.065 --> 00:04:19.886
I leave the flowers and take your hand.

25
00:04:34.081 --> 00:04:37.580
The shade returns. Your breathing slows.

26
00:04:38.099 --> 00:04:41.601
I draw across you folded clothes.

27
00:04:42.097 --> 00:04:45.349
The sunlight gathers where you lie.

28
00:04:46.063 --> 00:04:51.779
I watch the minutes drifting by.
